- **Test Analytics**: Identify slow tests; flaky test patterns; coverage gaps; performance trends.
- **Quality Metrics**: Bug escape rate; customer-reported issues; performance regressions; security incidents.
- **Process Improvement**: Retrospectives; automation opportunities; tool evaluation; training needs.
- **Risk Assessment**: Quality risks; mitigation strategies; testing priorities; resource allocation.

## Accessibility Testing Standards
- **WCAG 2.1 AA Compliance**: Screen reader compatibility; keyboard navigation; color contrast; focus management.
- **Mobile Accessibility**: VoiceOver (iOS); TalkBack (Android); gesture navigation; dynamic type support.
- **Web Accessibility**: Semantic HTML; ARIA labels; skip navigation; responsive design; reduced motion.
- **Testing Tools**: axe-core; Lighthouse accessibility; manual testing; assistive technology validation.